    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατα-πήγνῡμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thrust firmly in</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφος . . κουλεῷ ἐγκατέπηξ</span>' <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.98
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δὲ σκόλοπας κατέπηξεν</span>
			<i>planted</i> or <i>fixed</i> them <i>in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.350
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κεφαλὴν δόρατι ἐ</span>.
				<i>having fixed</i> it <i>on</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.13.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
			<i>sheathe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.313e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
